Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.07,0:00:17.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've finally come out, Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.45,0:00:22.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A job well done, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.03,0:00:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You managed to avenge your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.03,0:00:29.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what's most impressive is that you\Nalso found the time to track me down. Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.27,0:00:32.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll gladly kill you to celebrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.85,0:00:35.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I think we should\Nstart with this first.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.89,0:00:42.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give you a chance to rethink.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.99,0:00:45.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Descend now and not only will you live,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.65,0:00:48.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll be given the\Nchance to serve me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.43,0:00:50.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or you could choose to rise forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.79,0:00:53.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, you'd be ascending to your doom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.35,0:00:58.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the two of us first met,\Nfear consumed me like a curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.83,0:01:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It gave your evil Card blanche\Nto manipulate me like a puppet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.73,0:01:07.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That fear was the beginning of a\Nfutile existence with no end in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.77,0:01:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a fate worse than death.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.79,0:01:13.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A wretched life devoid of any desire\Nother than doing your bidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.33,0:01:20.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that fear has been eradicated,\Nleaving only the burning will to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.59,0:01:23.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've spent 45 days traveling with Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.75,0:01:25.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar and the others\Nand in honor of those who
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.01,0:01:28.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Died on that journey,\NI'll never fear you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.19,0:01:36.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My aren't we confident climb these\Nstairs and put that bravado to the test?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.83,0:01:44.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quite the interesting decision Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.23,0:01:48.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've backed down after\Nall is that your clever
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.31,0:01:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,way of telling me you\Nwant your former life?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.43,0:01:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.35,0:02:00.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.47,0:02:04.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I went up the stairs. I'm\Nsure. What happened? Problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.85,0:02:07.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seem to be shaken, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.33,0:02:08.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.89,0:02:12.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could the winds of fear have\Nextinguished your burning resolve?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.25,0:02:15.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps the only steps you\Ntook were in your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.09,0:02:18.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in actuality, fear\Noverrode your consciousness,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.35,0:02:22.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wrestling control from your brain\Ncausing you to descend down the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.45,0:02:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.43,0:02:25.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm positive I just\Nwalked up those stairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.35,0:02:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.27,0:02:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he doing this with his stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.35,0:02:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.27,0:02:36.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It couldn't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.45,0:02:41.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio's stand is...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.79,0:02:44.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,...the world?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.79,0:02:47.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to do now?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.52,0:02:55.36,SC Opening 2 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,952.999)}Seeking out...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.07,0:03:15.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.53,0:03:19.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The devil is not gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.93,0:03:20.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.81,0:03:22.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.93,0:03:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are still looking for a\Nplace where we are still not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.35,0:03:28.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are still alive. We are still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.95,0:03:34.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we are in the end of the battle,\Nwe are still alive. We will stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.07,0:03:42.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The story of the story\Nwas that we are now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.93,0:04:00.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The end of the world!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:20.65,0:04:26.16,Title 3,title,0,0,0,,{\fad(985,689)\pos(135,858)}Episode 45: Dio's World, Part 1
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.89,0:04:23.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm curious, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.27,0:04:26.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you ever wondered what\Nthe human soul desires most?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.01,0:04:28.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Peace of mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.87,0:04:32.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Subconsciously, all humans\Nwish to overcome their fears.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.03,0:04:33.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They seek fame,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.37,0:04:39.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,money, and dominance of others, all to\Nobtain a sense of everlasting security.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.63,0:04:41.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a farce.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.59,0:04:44.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They create bonds as a\Nmeans of self-preservation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.09,0:04:49.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They say they wish to help others,\Npurely for the sake of love and justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.73,0:04:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's only to settle\Ntheir feeble minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.93,0:04:56.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Humanity's greatest desire\Nis to attain serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.05,0:04:58.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.35,0:04:59.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why refuse to serve me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.13,0:05:02.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What greater serenity is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.35,0:05:05.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Return to me and all I\Nspeak of will be yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.15,0:05:07.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't want to challenge me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.15,0:05:11.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's just no point in running\Nheadlong into a meaningless death.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.59,0:05:13.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You deserve much more.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.21,0:05:15.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.25,0:05:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I seriously letting\Nhim draw me back in?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.09,0:05:20.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a talented stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.71,0:05:22.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would be a shame to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.49,0:05:27.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turn your back on Joestar\Nand live as my right hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.79,0:05:30.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise you unending peace starting now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.35,0:05:32.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to resist.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.95,0:05:36.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol, Iggy... I need your courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.29,0:05:39.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cut the bullshit, Dio!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.37,0:05:41.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've already stared death in the eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.25,0:05:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'll gladly do it again, if it\Nhelps uncover your stand's abilities!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.31,0:05:50.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How disappointing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.49,0:05:59.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to meet your end, Polnareff!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.23,0:06:02.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's your stand, the world! Bring it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.45,0:06:19.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's... Mr. Joestar!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.83,0:06:22.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no need to worry, Paul the Rep.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.23,0:06:27.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.23,0:06:28.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was Dio!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.17,0:06:30.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.37,0:06:32.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to tell you something first!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.69,0:06:36.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was only out in the open for a moment\Nor two, but I saw him use his stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.89,0:06:41.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, well, I didn't actually see it, but\NI did feel it in a manner of speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.51,0:06:45.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's complicated, but here's\Nthe long and short of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.61,0:06:47.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was heading up the stairs\Nto beat the life out of
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.07,0:06:51.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that bastard when suddenly\NI was back where I started.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.81,0:06:55.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe me, I know what I'm saying\Ndoesn't make any sense at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.27,0:06:57.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wrap my head around\Nwhat happened either.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.77,0:07:00.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like I'm losing my mind over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.59,0:07:03.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he wasn't using\Nany sort of hypnosis.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.27,0:07:06.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd say super speed, but there's no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.89,0:07:10.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I know is that I sense\Nsomething utterly terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.07,0:07:15.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, where are Iggy and Abbacchio?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.25,0:07:21.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They didn't make it. They're both dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.29,0:07:25.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They died trying to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.31,0:07:33.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.61,0:07:39.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.15,0:07:40.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.07,0:07:42.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, the sun is setting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.37,0:07:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.63,0:07:45.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.89,0:07:48.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, out with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.37,0:07:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's waiting for us upstairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.19,0:07:52.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The towers!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.75,0:07:54.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's also another room at the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.71,0:07:56.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's where Lord Dio dwells during the day!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.79,0:07:58.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there another staircase to the tower?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.71,0:08:01.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, this is the only set\Nof stairs that leads there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.83,0:08:03.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, lead the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.61,0:08:25.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.99,0:08:27.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The two of us have never met.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.27,0:08:32.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I've known about this monster\Nfor longer than I care to remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.47,0:08:34.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could I not know this fiend?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.33,0:08:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thought of him has been burned into\Nmy mind ever since the day I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.05,0:08:41.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Same for Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.17,0:08:46.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd hoped this day would never come,\Nthat we'd never have to face Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.71,0:08:50.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But as Joestars, we knew we'd\Neventually have to destroy him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.27,0:08:52.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.35,0:08:55.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I came on this journey\Nof my own free will,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.81,0:08:58.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I can live with whatever\Nhappens from here on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.95,0:09:02.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen things more clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.17,0:09:05.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally, it's like a light of\Nclarity has washed over me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.55,0:09:08.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My friends are that light,\Nwhile Dio is darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.41,0:09:13.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My body may be broken and battered,\Nbut the fear has vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.87,0:09:16.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Virtue and light has purified my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.77,0:09:20.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll attack the moment Dio\Nsteps out of the coffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.69,0:09:21.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay at the ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.99,0:09:24.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't know what tricks\Nhe has up his sleeves.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.33,0:09:27.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time, loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.13,0:09:29.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Open the coffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.19,0:09:31.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.11,0:09:34.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever happens ordeal, you have\Nto know I never betrayed you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.43,0:09:37.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only led these\Ndegenerates here because I
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.03,0:09:40.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,knew you had the power to\Neasily dispose of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.99,0:09:44.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As certain as a man wetting\Nhimself when pissing in the wind,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.09,0:09:47.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your victory is assured\Nyou are all-powerful!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.35,0:09:49.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't be angry with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.55,0:09:50.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough of the groveling!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.95,0:09:52.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Open the damn coffin!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.01,0:09:55.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.71,0:09:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give these bastards a\Ncruel and horrifying end!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.03,0:10:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ordeal!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.35,0:10:03.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get ready, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.13,0:10:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.79,0:10:16.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.07,0:10:18.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd I get in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.39,0:10:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just opening the coffin!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.47,0:10:21.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.39,0:10:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did he...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.30,0:10:24.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My eyes were locked on\NLoser Boy the entire time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.93,0:10:26.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did anyone else see him get in the coffin?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.73,0:10:29.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, did someone put him\Nin there without us knowing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.11,0:10:32.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I was watching him just like you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.37,0:10:35.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's opening the coffin one second\Nand the next he's inside it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.53,0:10:36.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.81,0:10:38.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't believe it's a mind trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.75,0:10:41.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's not super speed\Neither. Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.89,0:10:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he playing games with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.61,0:10:47.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.75,0:10:50.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.43,0:10:53.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.27,0:10:58.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.69,0:11:04.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, what was that feeling back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.41,0:11:07.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ominous presence it was\Ngiving off was far more powerful
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.39,0:11:10.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,than any stand our group\Nhas ever encountered before!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.27,0:11:12.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was like knowing a\Nbulldozer is coming after
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.79,0:11:15.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you just from the sound\Nof its roaring engine!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.25,0:11:16.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I sensed it too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.01,0:11:18.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An insane lust to kill us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.95,0:11:21.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It felt like somebody\Nshoving an icicle up my ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.01,0:11:26.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we hadn't escaped when we did, whatever\Nthat was would have killed us for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.59,0:11:41.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.65,0:11:42.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just look at the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.17,0:11:45.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost gone below the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.97,0:11:48.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio will have the advantage in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.37,0:11:52.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on. Come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.63,0:11:55.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't tell me you guys are\Nplanning to run away and hide until dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.67,0:11:57.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, Mr. Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.91,0:11:59.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm finishing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.23,0:12:01.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'm packing\Nup and heading for the hills.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.89,0:12:02.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.81,0:12:05.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to see this through to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.29,0:12:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to get this over with as much as\Nyou do, but the tied up battle has turned.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.37,0:12:16.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While not up close, we\Nface to stand the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.45,0:12:19.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we still have no\Nidea what its powers are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.13,0:12:20.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're fighting blind here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.73,0:12:21.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think of it this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.75,0:12:23.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like mountain climbing\Nwithout knowing the route.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.91,0:12:26.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we try to fight Dio\Nright now, we'll all die!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.33,0:12:31.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That fact is as inevitable as burping\Nafter knocking back a couple of colas!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.23,0:12:36.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio would be a fool not\Nto come racing after us,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.23,0:12:38.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he only has until sunrise to kill us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.81,0:12:39.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the meantime,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.79,0:12:43.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we need to learn the extent of his stance\Npower and find a way to put him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.79,0:12:46.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we can just hold\Nout until then… No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.59,0:12:48.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going back on my word!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.75,0:12:51.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol and Iggy died\Nbecause of my weakness!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.33,0:12:53.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to kill Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.15,0:12:55.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go to hell and back to do it,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.53,0:12:59.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but what I won't do is run\Naway from my obligation. No,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.59,0:13:01.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back, pull the wrap. Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.87,0:13:03.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not gonna listen, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.31,0:13:06.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think we should do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.79,0:13:14.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He went down there to fight Dio as\Nwe retreat will also be fighting him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.61,0:13:18.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means we'll be attacking\Nfrom both sides at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.75,0:13:25.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, buddy, let us buy this truck off you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.93,0:13:26.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.03,0:13:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hell is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.71,0:13:31.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This baby's my bread and butter! No, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.47,0:13:32.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.19,0:13:36.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Buckle up, cock-o-een.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.19,0:13:55.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you are, Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.11,0:13:57.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think I'll just run till dawn?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.89,0:13:59.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've crossed the wrong Frenchman.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.77,0:14:02.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll settle this on my own if I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.31,0:14:05.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what if I don't know\Nhow Dio's stand works?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.69,0:14:07.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just find another way to defeat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.99,0:14:08.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.89,0:14:12.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.15,0:14:16.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had them let you go cause convincing\Nstubborn guys like you is a pain in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.79,0:14:20.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the old men in Kakyoin insisted\NI stay close and watch your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.87,0:14:21.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So here I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.91,0:14:23.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Totoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.63,0:14:26.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, good grief.
